{"book":"hono","chapter":"helpers","chapterTitle":"المساعدات","slug":"factory","title":"مساعد `Factory`","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"import","text":"Import"},{"depth":2,"id":"createfactory","text":"createFactory()"},{"depth":3,"id":"الخيارات","text":"الخيارات"},{"depth":3,"id":"defaultappoptions-honooptions","text":"defaultAppOptions: HonoOptions"},{"depth":2,"id":"createmiddleware","text":"createMiddleware()"},{"depth":2,"id":"factorycreatehandlers","text":"factory.createHandlers()"},{"depth":2,"id":"factorycreateapp","text":"factory.createApp()"}],"html":"<p>يوفر Factory Helper دوالًا مفيدة لإنشاء مكونات Hono مثل الوسائط (Middleware). في بعض الأحيان يصعب تعيين أنواع TypeScript الصحيحة، لكن هذا المساعد يسهل ذلك.</p>\n<h2 id=\"import\">Import</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { createFactory, createMiddleware } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/factory&#x27;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"createfactory\"><code>createFactory()</code></h2>\n<p><code>createFactory()</code> ستنشئ نسخة من صنف Factory.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { createFactory } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/factory&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> factory = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createFactory</span>()\n</code></pre>\n<p>يمكنك تمرير أنواع Env الخاصة بك كأنواع عامة (Generics):</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Env</span> = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Variables</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">foo</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>\n  }\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> factory = createFactory&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Env</span>&gt;()\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"الخيارات\">الخيارات</h3>\n<h3 id=\"defaultappoptions-honooptions\"><Badge type=\"info\" text=\"optional\" /> defaultAppOptions: <code>HonoOptions</code></h3>\n<p>الخيارات الافتراضية لتمريرها إلى تطبيق Hono المُنشأ بواسطة <code>createApp()</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> factory = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createFactory</span>({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">defaultAppOptions</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">strict</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span> },\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = factory.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createApp</span>() <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// `strict: false` is applied</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"createmiddleware\"><code>createMiddleware()</code></h2>\n<p><code>createMiddleware()</code> اختصار لـ <code>factory.createMiddleware()</code>.\nستنشئ هذه الدالة برمجيتك الوسيطة المخصّصة.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> messageMiddleware = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createMiddleware</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c, next) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">next</span>()\n  c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">res</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">headers</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">set</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;X-Message&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Good morning!&#x27;</span>)\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p>نصيحة: إذا كنت تريد الحصول على وسيط (argument) مثل <code>message</code>، يمكنك إنشاؤه كدالة كما يلي.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">messageMiddleware</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">message</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span></span>) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createMiddleware</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c, next) =&gt; {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">next</span>()\n    c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">res</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">headers</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">set</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;X-Message&#x27;</span>, message)\n  })\n}\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">messageMiddleware</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Good evening!&#x27;</span>))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"factorycreatehandlers\"><code>factory.createHandlers()</code></h2>\n<p><code>createHandlers()</code> يساعد على تعريف المعالجات في مكان مختلف عن <code>app.get('/')</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { createFactory } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/factory&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { logger } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/logger&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ...</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> factory = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createFactory</span>()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> middleware = factory.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createMiddleware</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c, next) =&gt; {\n  c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">set</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;foo&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;bar&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">next</span>()\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> handlers = factory.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createHandlers</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">logger</span>(), middleware, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>(c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">var</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">foo</span>)\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api&#x27;</span>, ...handlers)\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"factorycreateapp\"><code>factory.createApp()</code></h2>\n<p><code>createApp()</code> يساعد في إنشاء نسخة (instance) من Hono بالأنواع المناسبة. إذا استخدمت هذه الطريقة مع <code>createFactory()</code>، يمكنك تجنّب التكرار في تعريف <code>Env</code> نوع.</p>\n<p>إذا كان تطبيقك مثل هذا، فعليك ضبط <code>Env</code> في مكانين:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { createMiddleware } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/factory&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Env</span> = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Variables</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">myVar</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>\n  }\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 1. Set the `Env` to `new Hono()`</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Env</span>&gt;()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 2. Set the `Env` to `createMiddleware()`</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> mw = createMiddleware&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Env</span>&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c, next) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">next</span>()\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(mw)\n</code></pre>\n<p>باستخدام <code>createFactory()</code> و <code>createApp()</code>، يمكنك ضبط <code>Env</code> في مكان واحد فقط.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { createFactory } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/factory&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ...</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Set the `Env` to `createFactory()`</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> factory = createFactory&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Env</span>&gt;()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = factory.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createApp</span>()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// factory also has `createMiddleware()`</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> mw = factory.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createMiddleware</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c, next) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">next</span>()\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p><code>createFactory()</code> يمكنه استقبال <code>initApp</code> خيار لتهيئة <code>app</code> أنشأه <code>createApp()</code>. فيما يلي مثال يستخدم الخيار.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// factory-with-db.ts</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Env</span> = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Bindings</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">MY_DB</span>: D1Database\n  }\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Variables</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">db</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">DrizzleD1Database</span>\n  }\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> createFactory&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Env</span>&gt;({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">initApp</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">app</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n    app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c, next) =&gt; {\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> db = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">drizzle</span>(c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">env</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">MY_DB</span>)\n      c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">set</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;db&#x27;</span>, db)\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">next</span>()\n    })\n  },\n})\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// crud.ts</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> factoryWithDB <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;./factory-with-db&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = factoryWithDB.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createApp</span>()\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">post</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">var</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">db</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">insert</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ...</span>\n})\n</code></pre>\n"}